		<Question><TranslatedText>Loading the BP+ module... Connect BP+ Measure Cancel Check device</TranslatedText><redcap:FormattedTranslatedText>&lt;div id=&quot;bpplus-status&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;Loading the BP+ module...&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:10px;&quot;&gt; &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; id=&quot;bpplus-connect&quot; class=&quot;btn btn-primaryrc&quot;&gt;Connect BP+&lt;/button&gt; &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; id=&quot;bpplus-measure&quot; class=&quot;btn btn-primaryrc&quot; disabled&gt;Measure&lt;/button&gt; &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; id=&quot;bpplus-cancel&quot; class=&quot;btn btn-defaultrc&quot; disabled&gt;Cancel&lt;/button&gt; &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; id=&quot;bpplus-ping&quot; class=&quot;btn btn-defaultrc&quot; disabled&gt;Check device&lt;/button&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div id=&quot;bpplus-alerts&quot; style=&quot;display:none;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div id=&quot;bpplus-results&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div id=&quot;bpplus-device-info&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</redcap:FormattedTranslatedText></Question>
